# CC Admin Dashboard & User Lifecycle Management

Namaste! Aapke requirements aur standard IT Identity and Access Management (IAM) systems ko study karne ke baad, maine CC Admin Dashboard ke liye ek comprehensive plan banaya hai. Isme Admin Sir ki saari requests (User Creation, View, Flag 0/1, Suspend, Archive) cover ki gayi hain, aur kuch extra security/management features (Sujhav) bhi add kiye gaye hain jo BHU ke working style aur modern systems ke hisaab se zaroori hain.

## Open Questions

> [!WARNING]
> Please review these questions before proceeding:
> 1. **Suspension vs Deletion:** Kya "Archive" karne par Google Workspace se email permanently delete karna hai, ya sirf access block karke data retain karna hai? (Best practice: Data retain karna chahiye for 1 year). Main abhi ke liye "Account Suspension" + "Status Archive" implement karunga bina data delete kiye.
> 2. **Bulk Actions:** Kya CC Admin ko ek sath multiple users ko approve/suspend karne ka option chahiye (Bulk selection)?

## Sujhav (Additional Recommended Features)

Modern IT Admin systems ke hisaab se, yeh features hone chahiye:
1. **Password Reset / Resend Credentials:** Agar kisi user ko apna password nahi mila ya bhool gaya, toh Admin ek click me naya temporary password generate karke unke alternate email par bhej sake.
2. **Audit Logs Viewer:** Admin dekh sake ki kis CC admin ne kab kis user ka account banaya ya suspend kiya. Yeh security audit ke liye bohot zaroori hai.
3. **Storage Quota Dashboard:** Total kitna GB allot ho chuka hai (e.g., 20GB for Faculty, 5GB for Staff) uska ek visual chart, taaki BHU ka Google Workspace storage track ho sake.
4. **Google Workspace Sync (Mock):** Jab real API integrate hogi, toh Suspend/Archive action direct Google server par bhi account ko disable kar dega.

